or=\"#0000ff\">2011.1.13(목) ~2011.1.25(화)&nbsp;- 본관1층(101호)로 제출</font></u> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 모집인원 : 3~4명</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4. 모집학년 : 1~3학년(파견시기 기준)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;5.&nbsp;모집국가 : 라오스, 러시아, 몽골, 중국, 태국, 필리핀 (총 6개국)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 6. 파견기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">2011.6월 하순부터 2011.7월 하순까지 하계방학기간<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;중 3주간</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;7. 학생 1인당 참가비</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 라오스, 러시아 : 850,000원</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 몽골, 태국 : 800,000원</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3) 중국, 필리핀 : 750,000원</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4) 중국천진 : 650,000원<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;